    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέκω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		2pl.
		pres. imper. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείκετε</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Od.
			18.316
		</span></i> (metri gr.), but also inf.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείκειν</span></b>  (v. infr.) : aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.279
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Euph.
			</span></i>) :—
				Med.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεξάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.176
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέχθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					1356
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>comb</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴρια
			π</span>. <i>card</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.316
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεξε καλὰς Εὔδοξος ἐθείρας</span>
			<u>AP</u>l. c. :— 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτας πεξαμένη</span>
			<i>when she had combed her</i> hair, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.176
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄϊς πείκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					775
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.38
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόκοις πέξασθαι</span>
			<i>have their</i> wool <i>shorn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				28.13
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέξαθ᾽ ὁ Κριός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					13
				</span></i>
			(cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1356
			</span></i>) :—
				Pass.
			, Ar.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέκεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					531.5
				</span></i>
			. (Cf. Lith. <i>pèšti</i>
		'pluck'.)</div>
